{%- comment -%}
  Fyxx: Brand line (product block)
  Part of the wine-template buy column.
  Renders product.metafields.custom.brand directly above the <h1> as the lead of
  the buy column: uppercase, letter-spaced, bold and full ink, so it reads as the
  producer name rather than a faint eyebrow. Not clickable yet (a link is a later
  job). Renders nothing if the metafield is blank. No font-family is declared; it
  inherits the theme body font.

  Guard: custom.brand is "#REF!" on most wines, a broken spreadsheet formula
  that was imported into the metafield. Treat that exact string as blank and
  render nothing, so the catalogue-wide rollout never prints "#REF!" above a
  title. Safety net only; the metafield data is cleaned separately.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign brand = product.metafields.custom.brand.value
  if brand == '#REF!'
    assign brand = ''
  endif
-%}

{%- if brand != blank -%}
  <div class="fx-brand" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {%- render 'element.text', text: brand, as: 'p', text_transform: 'uppercase', classlist: 'fx-brand__text' -%}
  </div>

  <style>
    .fx-brand__text {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: #100F0D;
    }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
